"drilio.\n"

#. i18n: /home/martin/xtrackcad/src/gtk3/app/lib/demos/dmdelund.xtr:33
#: ../../build/app/i18n/custmsg.h:379
msgid ""
"Pressing the <Delete> button lets you delete selected tracks from the "
