msgstr ""
"Mae pwyso'r botwm <Delete> yn caniatáu ichi ddileu traciau dethol o'r "
"cynllun.\n"

#: ../../build/app/i18n/custmsg.h:380
msgid ""
"First you select the tracks you want to delete, and then press the <Delete> "
