"Uchaf yw 5 cant.\n"

#. i18n: /home/martin/xtrackcad/src/gtk3/app/lib/demos/dmexcept.xtr:48
#: ../../build/app/i18n/custmsg.h:492
msgid ""
"If we make the curved track sharper it will be drawn in the Exception "
