#. i18n: /home/martin/xtrackcad/src/gtk3/app/lib/demos/dmhndld.xtr:29
#: ../../build/app/i18n/custmsg.h:674
msgid ""
"    Hint: the further you drag from the frog, the more accurate the angle.\n"
